---
import { ArrowRight, Database, FileText } from 'lucide-react';
import { Badge } from '../../components/ui/badge';
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import { buildCatalog } from '../../lib/catalog';
import { catalogUrl } from '../../lib/catalog-url';

const catalog = buildCatalog();
---

<SiteLayout title="Bundel data — AHS-ID" description="Daftar bundel data AHSP yang menjadi sumber katalog AHS-ID.">
  <section class="border-b border-border/80 bg-card/45"><div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 pb-14 pt-16 lg:px-8 lg:pb-20 lg:pt-24"><p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-primary">Sumber data</p><h1 class="mt-4 max-w-4xl font-serif text-5xl tracking-[-0.04em] sm:text-7xl">Bundel yang membentuk katalog.</h1><p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-muted-foreground">Setiap bundel membawa metadata regulasi, versi, bidang, dan jumlah item sumber. Buka item di katalog untuk melihat struktur dan jejak sumber per baris.</p></div></section>
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-16 lg:px-8 lg:py-24">
    <div class="grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-2">
      {catalog.bundles.map((bundle, index) => (
        <a class="bundle-card-link group pressable block rounded-3xl border border-border bg-card/50 p-7 transition-[transform,border-color,box-shadow] duration-200 ease-out hover-fine-card sm:p-9" href={catalogUrl({ bundle: bundle.id })}>
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-5"><span class="grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-2xl bg-primary text-primary-foreground"><Database aria-hidden="true" className="h-5 w-5" /></span><span class="font-mono text-sm text-muted-foreground">0{index + 1}</span></div>
          <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-2"><Badge>{bundle.version}</Badge><Badge variant="outline">{bundle.regulation}</Badge></div>
          <h2 class="mt-5 font-serif text-3xl">{bundle.name}</h2><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground">{bundle.source}</p>
          <dl class="mt-8 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 border-t border-border/80 pt-5 text-sm"><div><dt class="text-muted-foreground">Item publik</dt><dd class="mt-1 font-mono text-xl">{bundle.publicItemCount.toLocaleString('id-ID')}</dd></div><div><dt class="text-muted-foreground">Item sumber</dt><dd class="mt-1 font-mono text-xl">{bundle.sourceItemCount.toLocaleString('id-ID')}</dd></div></dl>
          <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2">{bundle.bidang.map((field) => <Badge variant="muted">{field}</Badge>)}</div>
          <div class="mt-8 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-primary">Jelajahi bundel <ArrowRight aria-hidden="true" className="h-4 w-4 transition-[transform,color] duration-200 ease-out group-hover-fine-arrow" /></div>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 flex gap-4 rounded-3xl border border-border bg-background p-6 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground sm:p-8"><FileText aria-hidden="true" className="mt-1 h-5 w-5 shrink-0 text-primary" /><p>Bundel sumber tetap berada di paket masing-masing. Katalog web hanya menyajikan normalisasi metadata untuk pencarian dan tampilan, sehingga engine dan data publik tetap bisa digunakan tanpa website ini.</p></div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
